  "details": "If you want to add better (Cartoon-standard live) lip syncing (With 11 possible mouth positions -“visemes”) to VRChat, You might consider reaching out to Adobe for the Live Lip sync algorithm used in Adobe Character Animator. \nLive Cartoon-Standard (11-viseme) Lip syncing in VRChat will help VRChat become a better story-teller (ex. Especially when VRChat sessions are captured to YouTube)!\n\nHere is more information on an advanced live lip-Sync technology that might be included in Adobe Character Animator someday. The email addresses of the latest lip sync algorithm programmers are included in this PDF: https://arxiv.org/pdf/1910.08685\nThank you, I look forward to seeing viseme lip-Sync in VRChat!",
